{"name": "Stack Prootocol", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/2c19091d16bb4a393984a72da3288a5c.poster.avif?t=1772652682\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/2c19091d16bb4a393984a72da3288a5c.webm?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/2c19091d16bb4a393984a72da3288a5c.mp4?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become <i>Meep</i>, the bouncy digital USB-mouse, and fix outdated equipment the only way you know how: More <i>RAM</i>! Follow your calling and embark on a quest to collect enough RAM and repair a  broken toaster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/1e05805a67885ecec334aeb61ff881e8.poster.avif?t=1772652682\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/1e05805a67885ecec334aeb61ff881e8.webm?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/1e05805a67885ecec334aeb61ff881e8.mp4?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To download RAM, you will have to enter and traverse cyberspace. Cyberspace is, of course, all blocks and pixels... Can you clear all levels and unlock each new gigabyte of RAM?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/c16e7adbe9e9e2844c8cd605912b9b2b.poster.avif?t=1772652682\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/c16e7adbe9e9e2844c8cd605912b9b2b.webm?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/c16e7adbe9e9e2844c8cd605912b9b2b.mp4?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Stack Prootocol</i> is a cute, little puzzle platformer in which you will...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slide!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move and Rotate Blocks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat your personal best times!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\"Meep!\"</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/09e51d4c02ed2b508a6386b5913baf4a.poster.avif?t=1772652682\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/09e51d4c02ed2b508a6386b5913baf4a.webm?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/09e51d4c02ed2b508a6386b5913baf4a.mp4?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bounce and puzzle your way through <strong>40+</strong> levels!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level has an intended solution that is quick to execute, once you <i>have</i> found it; but often  there are multiple ways to reach the same goal\u2014find your very own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your dexterity, problem solving and platforming skills. Can you beat the extra challenging bonus levels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/4b8d09dd7fb5e84a8719105fac476703.poster.avif?t=1772652682\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/4b8d09dd7fb5e84a8719105fac476703.webm?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/4b8d09dd7fb5e84a8719105fac476703.mp4?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/facf312df1f3763de8b9747d0e48c575.poster.avif?t=1772652682\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/facf312df1f3763de8b9747d0e48c575.webm?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/facf312df1f3763de8b9747d0e48c575.mp4?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A puzzle-platformer with gravity-defying, block-stacking action. Play as Meep, a RAM-loving USB-mouse, on a quest in cyberspace to repair a broken toaster. Create new paths and jump to your goal\u2014but watch out for the digital void!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/e3528c53a318ef1085a5f53eb53a8d02ad160459/header.jpg?t=1772652682", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Casual", "3D Platformer", "Platformer", "Retro", "Cute", "Parkour"], "developers": "Dare Looks, Mahmu-Kai", "publishers": "Dare Looks, Mahmu-Kai", "release_date": "Dec 4, 2025", "price": "$8.99", "appid": "3937000", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "4 March 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/TMsasg9e4GE", "first_seen": 1772578800.0, "review_rank": 1056}